  "hindi": "आकाश की चार दिशाएँ और पृथ्वी की चार दिशाएँ, देवों ने गर्भ को गति दी है; वे उसे प्रसव के लिए खोल दें।",
  "english": "The four regions of the sky and the four of the earth, the gods have set the embryo in motion together; let them open it up for the bearing.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "'Four regions' of sky and earth are read as the quarters; src 'catasro divaḥ' has catasraḥ before voiced consonant. 'Sam airayan' could also be 'they sent forth together'.",
